sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant A as ✈ Aircraft
    participant IC as Initiating Controller<br/>(e.g., TRACON N90)
    participant RC as Receiving Controller<br/>(e.g., Center ZNY)
    participant Readers as All AircraftTracking<br/>Readers (Dashboard, etc.)

    Note over A,Readers: Aircraft is controlled by Initiating Controller

    A ->> IC: AircraftPosition (periodic 5 Hz, via CFT)
    A ->> RC: AircraftPosition (periodic 5 Hz, via CFT)
    IC ->> Readers: AircraftTracking [controller = IC]

    Note over IC: Trigger condition met<br/>(altitude/polygon exit)

    rect rgb(255, 248, 225)
        Note over IC,RC: Handoff Protocol (two-step)
        IC ->> RC: Handoff [status = INITIATED]<br/>(CFT: to/from_controller_id)

        RC ->> IC: Handoff [status = ACCEPTED]<br/>(CFT: to/from_controller_id)

        RC ->> Readers: AircraftTracking [controller = RC]<br/>(SHARED_OWNERSHIP, newer timestamp wins)

        Note over IC: unregister_instance(AircraftTracking)<br/>Removes aircraft from local tracking
    end

    Note over A,Readers: Aircraft is now controlled by Receiving Controller

    Note over A: Aircraft is passive —<br/>no Handoff subscription.<br/>Responds only to<br/>ControllerInstruction.
